    <string name="all_files_title">Allow file access</string>
    <string name="all_files_steps">In Onzetec Games, go to Permissions → Files and media and choose \"Allow all\" (manage all files). \"Media only\" is not enough to read the games. Then come back with Back: the Jogos folder is created right away.\n\nManual path in the TV Settings: Apps → Onzetec Games → Permissions → Files and media → Allow all. On other TVs: Apps → Special app access → All files access → Onzetec Games.</string>
